Package: eduka-konekta
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, librsvg2-common, python3-cryptography, ffmpeg, iproute2, v4l-utils, pulseaudio-utils
Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-noto-core
Maintainer: Hugo Moniz do Rego <grupoideatl@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://edukasaunos.tl
Description: peer-to-peer school messenger with exams and attendance
 Eduka-Konekta connects teachers and students directly over the school
 network without internet or a central server. It works over Wi-Fi and LAN
 cable (also mixed), bridges Wi-Fi client isolation through any reachable
 peer, and detects dropped Wi-Fi links automatically.
 .
 Features: class, school, teacher, group and private chat; announcements;
 exams and assignments (question files, multiple choice with automatic
 grading, essays, answer files, results and CSV export); one-click
 attendance; configurable school rules, room locks, exam mode and a word
 filter; photos, voice, video and documents; status feed; notifications.
 Interface in Indonesian, Tetum, Portuguese (Portugal and Brazil) and English.
